{"page":397,"verses":[{"verse_key":"29:7","surah":29,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ لَنُكَفِّرَنَّ عَنْهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ وَلَنَجْزِيَنَّهُمْ أَحْسَنَ ٱلَّذِى كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We shall certainly blot out the misdeeds of those who believe and do good deeds, and We shall reward them according to the best of their actions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous (deeds)","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَنُكَفِّرَنَّ","en_gloss":"surely, We will remove","transliteration":"lanukaffiranna","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their evil deeds","transliteration":"sayyiātihim","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَنَجْزِيَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"and We will surely reward them","transliteration":"walanajziyannahum","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَحْسَنَ","en_gloss":"(the) best","transliteration":"aḥsana","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) what","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"(to) do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"29:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:7"}]},{"verse_key":"29:8","surah":29,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"وَوَصَّيْنَا ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ حُسْنًا ۖ وَإِن جَـٰهَدَاكَ لِتُشْرِكَ بِى مَا لَيْسَ لَكَ بِهِۦ عِلْمٌ فَلَا تُطِعْهُمَآ ۚ إِلَىَّ مَرْجِعُكُمْ فَأُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have commanded people to be good to their parents, but do not obey them if they strive to make you serve, beside Me, anything of which you have no knowledge: you will all return to Me, and I shall inform you of what you have done.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوَصَّيْنَا","en_gloss":"And We have enjoined","transliteration":"wawaṣṣaynā","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","en_gloss":"(on) man","transliteration":"l-insāna","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","en_gloss":"goodness to his parents","transliteration":"biwālidayhi","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حُسْنًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"goodness to his parents","transliteration":"ḥus'nan","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"but if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَـٰهَدَاكَ","en_gloss":"they both strive against you","transliteration":"jāhadāka","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِتُشْرِكَ","en_gloss":"to make you associate","transliteration":"litush'rika","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِى","en_gloss":"with Me","transliteration":"bī","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَكَ","en_gloss":"you have","transliteration":"laka","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عِلْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"any knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'mun","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تُطِعْهُمَآ ۚ","en_gloss":"obey both of them","transliteration":"tuṭiʿ'humā","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَىَّ","en_gloss":"To Me","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَرْجِعُكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) your return","transliteration":"marjiʿukum","verse_key":"29:8"},{"pos":18,"ar"