k that human persecution is as severe as God’s punishment––yet, if any help comes to you [Prophet] from your Lord, they will say, ‘We have always been with you’. Does God not know best what is in everyone’s hearts?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And of","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(is he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"says","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","en_gloss":"We believe","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَإِذَآ","en_gloss":"But when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُوذِىَ","en_gloss":"he is harmed","transliteration":"ūdhiya","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(the Way of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"he considers","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِتْنَةَ","en_gloss":"(the) trial","transliteration":"fit'nata","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(of) the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَعَذَابِ","en_gloss":"as (the) punishment","transliteration":"kaʿadhābi","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَئِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wala-in","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":17,"ar":"جَآءَ","en_gloss":"comes","transliteration":"jāa","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":18,"ar":"نَصْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"victory","transliteration":"naṣrun","verse_key":"29:10"},{"pos":19,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","trans