","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَطَـٰيَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"their sins","transliteration":"khaṭāyāhum","verse_key":"29:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"29:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"شَىْءٍ ۖ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"29:12"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"29:12"},{"pos":18,"ar":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) surely liars","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","verse_key":"29:12"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٢","en_gloss":"(12)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"29:12"}]},{"verse_key":"29:13","surah":29,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَيَحْمِلُنَّ أَثْقَالَهُمْ وَأَثْقَالًا مَّعَ أَثْقَالِهِمْ ۖ وَلَيُسْـَٔلُنَّ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ عَمَّا كَانُوا۟ يَفْتَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will bear their own burdens and others besides: they will be questioned about their false assertions on the Day of Resurrection.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَيَحْمِلُنَّ","en_gloss":"But surely they will carry","transliteration":"walayaḥmilunna","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَثْقَالَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their burdens","transliteration":"athqālahum","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَأَثْقَالًۭا","en_gloss":"and burdens","transliteration":"wa-athqālan","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَثْقَالِهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their burdens","transliteration":"athqālihim","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَيُسْـَٔلُنَّ","en_gloss":"and surely they will be questioned","transliteration":"walayus'alunna","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَمَّا","en_gloss":"about what","transliteration":"ʿammā","verse_key":"29:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَانُو